{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00191","headline":"元日退朝观军仗归营 · 德宗皇帝","name":"元日退朝观军仗归营","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献岁视元朔，万方咸在庭。\n端旒揖羣后，回辇阅师贞。\n彩仗宿华殿，退朝归禁营。\n分行左右出，转斾风云生。\n历历趋复道，容容映层城。\n勇余矜捷技，令肃无喧声。\n眷此戎旅节，载嘉良士诚。\n顺时倾宴赏，亦以助文经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}